{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":170333,"ns":0,"title":"Case-based reasoning","extract":"Case-based reasoning (CBR), broadly construed, is the process of solving new problems based on the solutions of similar past problems.\nIn everyday life, an auto mechanic who fixes an engine by recalling another car that exhibited similar symptoms is using case-based reasoning.","description":"Process of solving new problems based on the solutions of similar past problems","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}